				},
				{
					"id": 750220607,
					"content": "（咕——）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奇怪的匿葉龍"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220608,
					"content": "咦，難道是肚子餓了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220609,
					"content": "牠一隻龍孤零零地在這裡，主人也不見了，大概也沒有辦法自己去覓食…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220610,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我們找點吃的餵給牠吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220611,
					"content": "等牠吃飽了乖乖讓開，寶藏就是我們的啦，嘿嘿…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220612,
					"content": "餵牠什麼好呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750220613,
					"content": "讓我想想…納塔這邊的龍好像什麼都多少會吃一點，也不知道匿葉龍喜歡吃什麼…看牠的顏色，總覺得會喜歡吃什麼草啊、葉子什麼的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750220614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 750220614,
					"content": "先簡單找一樣試試看好了，餓了的傢伙大概不會挑食吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
